    spec: `<b>Elementor:</b> Container (3-col) · EK Image Box ×7. Seven into a 3-col grid leaves an orphan on the last row; adding Logistics &amp; Warehousing makes it eight and squares the grid — a small argument for building it.`,
  },

  {
    cls: "wash center",
    n: "BLOCK 03 · SERVICE CTA",
    h: `
  <h2>Learn More About Our Critical Situation Travel Labor Service</h2>
  <div class="btns" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn" href="${u("/overview")}">Learn More</a></div>`,
    spec: `<b>Elementor:</b> Heading · Button. Points back to the CSTL pillar.`,
  },

