  </tbody></table></div>
  <div class="note stop"><b>Changed in the prototype, flagged for sign-off.</b> Since the brief is to update these pages rather than replace them, they keep their existing URLs and their existing search equity. The proposed slugs would have meant new URLs, redirects, and starting over on ranking for pages that already rank. <b>Logistics is the one genuinely new URL, and it is placed under <code>/industries/</code> to match its siblings.</b></div>`,
    spec: `If the team does want the shorter slugs, that is a redirect plan and an SEO decision, not a copy decision — raise it before build, not after.`,
