  <div class="note"><b>Two of eight have update copy.</b> Automotive and Food &amp; Beverage are wireframed with copy still outstanding; Logistics is wireframed and new. The remaining five live pages have had no CSTL update written — they carry today’s copy until they do.</div>`,
