    h: `
  <p class="lead">Reading the live pages against the section’s own three SEO formulas — title 50–60 characters, exactly one H1, meta description 145–160 — the five that have had no update are uneven.</p>
  <div class="tscroll"><table class="cmp"><thead><tr><th>Page</th><th>SEO title today</th><th class="hl">Chars</th></tr></thead><tbody>
