  <div class="note">Every one of these is a title-and-description edit, not a rewrite. <b>Cheapest measurable win in the section</b> — worth doing whether or not the full CSTL updates are commissioned.</div>`,
    spec: `Rank Math fields only. No layout or copy-deck work required.`,
